<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6313" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">callōsus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		callum, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>with a hard skin</i>, <i>hard-skinned</i>, <i>thick-skinned</i>, <i>callous</i>
			(not before the Aug. per.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ulcus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 6,
					3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ulcera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					26, 14, 87, § 143</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">venter,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 37, 79, § 203</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crassior callosiorque cutis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 39, 92, § 226</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			gen., <i>solid</i>, <i>hard</i>, <i>thick</i>: ova, * <i><span class="en">Hor. S. 2,
				4, 14</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acini uvae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					3, 1, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">olivae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 3, 4, § 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tactus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. Sept. 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">orae (ulceris),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					5, 28</span></i>
			.</div>
